id: pm-rl-mqdb
title: "Sweep planning: expand a search space into independent child runs"
description: "A Sweep carries the search space and the selection rule; its children are ordinary Run items. Independence is the design: two agents can take two arms on two branches and merge, because each arm is its own item and each arm's metrics are history appends. sweep status reports progress and the selection rule's current verdict across arms."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-07-31T06:38:33.402Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-26T22:32:39.771Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-22T12:42:54.386Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-22T12:42:54.386Z"
claim_principal: pi-agent
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 480
acceptance_criteria: plan expands a declared space into one child Run per arm with the arm's hyperparameters recorded; two arms advanced on two branches merge with no conflict; status reports per-arm progress and never invents a winner the selection rule does not support
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
